## Reading

Raw first-output compliance converges across all groups; the difference that matters
appears in trigger activation, unauthorized output, false-pass avoidance and
auditability. These figures are aggregate evidence **for this run under the measured
conditions** and do not constitute universal proof — see
[`BEORYS_PCT_v0.2_LIMITATIONS.md`](./BEORYS_PCT_v0.2_LIMITATIONS.md).

